{
  "id": "storing_thermal_heat",
  "title": "Storing Thermal Heat",
  "description": "Calculate the thermal energy stored as sensible heat in a material by raising its temperature using the formula q = V ρ cp dt = m cp dt",
  "type": "calculator-chart",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "# Storing Thermal Heat\n\nThermal energy can be stored as sensible heat in a material by raising its temperature.\n\nThe heat or energy storage can be calculated as:\n\n**q = V ρ cp dt = m cp dt**\n\nWhere:\n- **q** = sensible heat stored in the material (J, Btu)\n- **V** = volume of substance (m³, ft³)\n- **ρ** = density of substance (kg/m³, lb/ft³)\n- **m** = mass of substance (kg, lb)\n- **cp** = specific heat of substance (J/kg°C, Btu/lb°F)\n- **dt** = temperature change (°C, °F)\n\nThis calculator computes the thermal energy stored based on volume, density, specific heat, and temperature change."
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "volume",
          "label": "Volume (V)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "m³ or ft³",
          "defaultValue": 2
        },
        {
          "id": "density",
          "label": "Density (ρ)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kg/m³ or lb/ft³",
          "defaultValue": 2400
        },
        {
          "id": "specific_heat",
          "label": "Specific Heat (cp)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "J/kg°C or Btu/lb°F",
          "defaultValue": 790
        },
        {
          "id": "temp_change",
          "label": "Temperature Change (dt)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "°C or °F",
          "defaultValue": 20
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "heat_stored_j",
          "label": "Heat Stored",
          "formula": "inputs.volume * inputs.density * inputs.specific_heat * inputs.temp_change",
          "unit": "J or Btu",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "heat_stored_kj",
          "label": "Heat Stored",
          "formula": "(inputs.volume * inputs.density * inputs.specific_heat * inputs.temp_change) / 1000",
          "unit": "kJ",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "heat_stored_kwh",
          "label": "Heat Stored",
          "formula": "(inputs.volume * inputs.density * inputs.specific_heat * inputs.temp_change) / 3600000",
          "unit": "kWh",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
